---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Food Crisis Solutions | Food Supply Crisis Report"
  description="Evidence-based solutions for resilient food systems, including water efficiency, crop resilience, storage, fertilizer efficiency, waste reduction and supply-chain diversification."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="shell">
      <p class="eyebrow">Solutions</p>
      <h1>Solutions to Food Supply Risks</h1>
      <p>Resilience is rarely one technology or one policy. Stronger food systems reduce exposure to shocks while protecting water, soil, farm incomes, storage capacity and reliable trade.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell">
      <h2>Practical resilience measures</h2>
      <div class="card-grid">
        <article class="card">
          <h2><a href="/articles/water-crisis-food-crisis/">Water efficiency</a></h2>
          <p>Smarter irrigation, groundwater management and drought resilience can reduce exposure to water-driven crop losses.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h2><a href="/articles/fertilizer-independence-resilient-farming/">Crop resilience</a></h2>
          <p>Diversified crops, resilient varieties and better farm practices can reduce the damage from weather and input shocks.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h2><a href="/articles/how-to-stockpile-food-and-water-sensibly-2026/">Food storage</a></h2>
          <p>Safe household and system-level storage can smooth short disruptions without encouraging hoarding or waste.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h2><a href="/articles/fertilizer-independence-resilient-farming/">Fertilizer efficiency</a></h2>
          <p>Better nutrient management and lower input vulnerability can help farms remain productive when fertilizer markets tighten.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h2><a href="/articles/black-sea-food-crisis-2026/">Supply diversification</a></h2>
          <p>More resilient suppliers, ports and trade routes can reduce the impact of a disruption concentrated in one corridor.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h2><a href="/articles/how-can-world-prevent-food-crisis-10-solutions/">Food-loss and waste reduction</a></h2>
          <p>Reducing losses across farming, storage, transport, retail and households can improve effective food availability without simply producing more.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
